[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568372154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113087#issuecomment-3568372154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113087","id":3568372154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UsQm6","user":{"login":"bazbrad765","id":191398860,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2iDzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191398860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765","html_url":"https://github.com/bazbrad765","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T21:54:15Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T21:54:15Z","body":"@TokageItLab \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568372154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568393569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113087#issuecomment-3568393569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113087","id":3568393569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UsV1h","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-23T22:15:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T22:20:31Z","body":"Basically, not only IK but other SkeletonModifiers also do not support scaling.\n\nWhen the mutable_bone_axis option (included in dev5) is enabled, you can extend bones based on bone pose position, but scaling requires a different implementation.\n\nConsidering that scaling via apply node scale can be applied by post importer, implementing a utility function to convert scaling into skin binding and bone position might be somewhat straightforward.\n\nWell, in any case, I think we should document for the state of scale supporting.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568393569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568572339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113087#issuecomment-3568572339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113087","id":3568572339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UtBez","user":{"login":"bazbrad765","id":191398860,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2iDzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191398860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765","html_url":"https://github.com/bazbrad765","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T00:36:27Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T00:36:27Z","body":"So that green preview line cant be resized to the skeleton? What is it sized to? The previous SkeletonIK3D node the green line was in line with and scaled to the skeleton. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568572339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568627819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113087#issuecomment-3568627819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113087","id":3568627819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UtPBr","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T01:13:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T01:17:29Z","body":"> The previous SkeletonIK3D node the green line was in line with and scaled to the skeleton.\n\nThe old SkeletonIK shouldn't have had a Gizmo.\n\n> What is it sized to?\n\nFirst, the your MRP's Armature is scaled by a factor of about 3. Also, it's strange that your Body/Cylinder MeshInstance is scaled to 1/3.\n\nThe Gizmo is bound to the Skeleton's skin. I don't know the details, but considering from above, it seems there are two layers of scaling by multiples of 3 in various places, resulting in a final scale of `(3*3*2*2)` = 36 times the original (non-scaled skeleton).\n\n> So that green preview line cant be resized to the skeleton?\n\nIn any case, most SkeletonModifiers do not handle scaling. This is because Godot's scaling allows non-uniform scaling and shearing, meaning bone lengths could change due to rotation in such cases; In other words, if bone lengths change during IK iterations, the calculations break, so stability during scaling cannot be guaranteed. Therefor, I don't see much point in only fixing Gizmo's appearance while the actual modifier's calculation is broken.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568627819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568640282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113087#issuecomment-3568640282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113087","id":3568640282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7UtSEa","user":{"login":"bazbrad765","id":191398860,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2iDzA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191398860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765","html_url":"https://github.com/bazbrad765","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazbrad765/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-24T01:24:49Z","updated_at":"2025-11-24T01:24:49Z","body":"Ok thanks so much for your insight and building this node!!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3568640282/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]